e_name": "screenshot02.png", "id": "1167270421589414", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393425_1167270424922747_1907140739452079368_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RJusfaTRKmQQ7kNvwHluTZW&_nc_oc=AdpwMw0PBK3y7BQsBd9L6r0-zvqU5UvQcgMHqLA0Ux4sXIdhuSyeNuOK8Do9Ts8-OXQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5quA8jNwyf40Z9NuDEVcMof5yR2O2RFUl7rrS_Ts3ZJg&oe=6A1DA079"}, {"file_name": "screenshot03.png", "id": "1320236425766559", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_1320236429099892_7026969068655260219_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZSSm9sRZ1F4Q7kNvwGxx4d7&_nc_oc=AdpyvzS99QhIJs11ZP36NQDr5Q-Q29xSymXUAc-J3MWMg_8s1ykbE8dy6t2wnUKD2nI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6sKVGJbVoNLu1XVWVLHC9ZBgHXDO0FVVSJhaRjFUvJ_Q&oe=6A1D77D3"}, {"file_name": "screenshot04.png", "id": "1408931723813604", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_1408931727146937_1574658016866773147_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NWaU16jiwpkQ7kNvwGB3Ptb&_nc_oc=Adp2WrPq1-M4MjWkue2EBaL59pUBXuZtZVrIuYlLp7Ci0G2aOgIP05e4YjKSpURx_LA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4nNcZboJjfr1mzSD1ltOX0wrhkYBGS8KyZNhEmNPjl2A&oe=6A1D837B"}, {"file_name": "screenshot05.png", "id": "418176134719567", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391998_418176138052900_6204508764481913331_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LW5m5jk9XzAQ7kNvwF_6wSY&_nc_oc=AdoXavVBMxZgUk-pFeK9u6T51UhNT4dhqWsBBmbbdy5tL4hVJTKcpyTag4K-QqYSTSc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6kHvmGW4sJr34lEbU9IZX7966GSb9YeEysooOmSBghOw&oe=6A1D84CA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail2.png", "id": "1152565683077389", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391896_1152565689744055_250834400001166292_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=q7_E0vogh-YQ7kNvwGXp1gf&_nc_oc=Adr4srcRAMmodU-4haa33pEin475sLx1j8XPCyNo_PqFYHvTSiopwpPtQTABW0cvDLc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7-0w6QTtS7QnxdZuPK4uwGmv2l6XwDFDzqLgh3Q5qYvQ&oe=6A1DA63E"}, "display_name": "Aerodrums 2", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking.\n\nAerodrums 2 is an expressive and versatile air drumming instrument. It is a standalone device that uses high-speed optical motion capture technology to accurately track the position of your drumsticks and feet in 3D. Unlike acoustic and traditional electronic drum sets, Aerodrums 2 is lightweight and portable, it is silent when used with headphones, and it takes up no space when not in use.\n\nPaired with Meta Quest headsets, Aerodrums 2 offers an unparalleled drumming experience. Passthrough mode and depth occlusion let you see your real hands and drumsticks while drumming, while hand-tracking is used to further improve stick-tracking accuracy.\n\nTo learn more about Aerodrums 2 visit aerodrums.com", "short_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking."}]}, "developer_name": "Aerodrums", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aerodrums.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_se